## Rollback
1. Remove the `/ai-test/*` rule from the URL map in the console.
2. Delete `ai-test-backend`, `ai-test-health-check` and `ai-test-ig`, and the firewall rule if you created one.
3. If something breaks, restore the backup with `gcloud compute url-maps import <URL_MAP> --global --source=url-map-backup-2026-10-09.yaml`.

## Caveat
